  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who hold anti-Latino/Hispanic sentiments, particularly those who support xenophobic narratives around immigration policy. The meme is designed to resonate with people who believe in the stereotype that Mexicans 'steal' green cards and jobs, often rooted in political or cultural attitudes that favor native-born citizens over immigrants. The visual of a proud Mexican citizen juxtaposed with the hateful text is intended to provoke or reinforce these prejudices among those who already subscribe to such tropes.",
